  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 864f32d36e36a5644aa8fbd495f2626a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Kal 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  line: I see. and I suppose you want this one? I found it while foraging this morning.
    Tell me first what will you do with it. I've been trying to decide all day.
  option1:
    text: I will return it to its nest, on top of the mountain.
    next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1785760bd4020a34da4164937c9486b3, type: 2}
    action: 0
  option2:
    text: I will take them to Doctor Dibbler. He has a plan to kill the dragon.
    next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: efbba614f72cb2841b0d7d29824055d7, type: 2}
    action: 0
